  "name": "Record of the Departed",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Record_of_the_Departed",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-11T05:51:38.089Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In the year 2147 of the Light Calendar, the holy city faced the calamity of the black tide and faded into the night."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This tome chronicles the fallen and records the sorrow of Okhema."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Alpheus and Malonza – Twin brothers who perished for the holy city."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Petros – A valiant Mountain Dweller, his sacrifice immortal."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Margusa - A wise researcher who unfortunately passed away at a market."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Ulysse – acolyte, perished while shielding companions."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Nereia – A Kephale priest, her mission ended at her resting place."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Antigone – Daughter of Acacias, perished in a collapsed home."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Theagis – A mother of three, perished embracing her youngest"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Albus – A righteous man, passed away in prayer."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Bolaris – A man of the people, perished facing the Black Tide Creatures."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Hygilos – A merchant, found dead in his shop."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Lucretia – A friend of the dromas, perished after fulfilling what should be done."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Marcus – A weathered man, met his fate beyond Okhema."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Hegesia – A humble soul, missing."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Ten unidentified bodies, features unrecognizable."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "May the grace of Thanatos guide these souls to a new world."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We shall meet again at the end of the west wind."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
